"""Task 3 codebook schema (v0). Single source of truth for 03_codebook.md, the validator and the blank sheet.

Kinds:
  single  one value from `values`
  multi   one or more values from `values`, separated by ';'. A value may also be `other:<label>` if `other_ok`.
  free    any non-empty text (use `not reported` or `TBD` when nothing can be said)
  pattern a value that must match `pattern`
Every coded field also accepts `not reported` (the sources read do not say) and, in draft mode, `TBD`
(a reviewer still has to look). `strict` fields accept neither.
"""

